# Cloudflare Pages: the response headers. Pages are revalidated on every visit, so that an update shows at once;
# the hashed build assets never change. A path that matches several rules gets the headers of all of them, so
# the assets' rule first detaches the pages' Cache-Control (!) and then sets its own.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
